# Codata Backend Configuration

# Configure at least one model provider before making real AI calls.
# OpenRouter is one supported option:
# CODATA_OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-v1-your-key-here

# Other provider keys can be configured through the app settings UI or env vars.
# Examples:
# CODATA_OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-your-key-here
# CODATA_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-your-key-here
# CODATA_GOOGLE_API_KEY=your-gemini-key-here
# CODATA_DOUBAO_API_KEY=your-volcengine-ark-key-here

# Optional: point the OpenAI provider at any OpenAI-compatible endpoint.
# Leave unset to use the official https://api.openai.com/v1.
# CODATA_OPENAI_BASE_URL=https://your-endpoint.example.com/v1

# Local OpenAI-compatible endpoint (optional)
# CODATA_LOCAL_BASE_URL=http://localhost:11434/v1

# Database (default: SQLite in ./data/)
# CODATA_DATABASE_URL=sqlite+aiosqlite:///./data/codata.db

# Server
# CODATA_HOST=0.0.0.0
# CODATA_PORT=8000
# CODATA_DEBUG=false

# Project directory (default: current directory)
# CODATA_PROJECT_DIR=.
